abstract: "A researcher-controlled Codex workflow that clarifies a hand-drawn scientific sketch, makes five separate ImageGen proposal calls, and reconstructs an explicitly selected direction as editable SVG and PowerPoint artifacts plus an experimental structural draw.io view, with programmable checks and separate human decisions."
keywords:
  - scientific figures
  - scientific visualization
  - editable vector graphics
  - human-in-the-loop
